-- texture of the rush, driven because its density is its meaning, and FOLLOWING him, since the server takes
-- his frame again on every stroke. On each stroke, a brush stroke slashed across the box, leaning the other
-- way from the last, a hot point, the pigment's landing and a shake: one per stroke, and only the last one
